      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think TeleportTo performs a Lerp. The reason you see it travel in multiplayer is because of the networking. The same thing happens with player's avatars and nametags when they respawn/teleport. In single player this isn't an issue, you just see an instantaneous teleport.\n\nStill, improving the networking to avoid this would be great!",
      "viewerReactions": null
