  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-18T05:18:04.858Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC_ObjectSync.TeleportTo currently lerps to the target position which causes undesirable behavior such as triggers in the world being activated when the teleported object passes through them.\n\nPlease update TeleportTo to instantly set the object's position to the target position on all clients, or add a flag to enable this behavior if you want to keep the existing behavior intact.",
